 \section{Scope and Evidence Contract}
 This supplement reports protocol details, full strata, and every result that materially limits a submitted claim. Experiments are included according to relevance, not favorability. The manuscript does not claim a new reconstruction architecture, calibrated uncertainty, universal estimator superiority, plane-invariant influence, local failure localization, or prospective acquisition benefit.
 
 The independent units are 24 fastMRI examinations, 115 IXI examinations, and eight NingXia patients containing 22 series. All NingXia intervals resample patients with subordinate series, planes, models, and contexts retained. Missing target values are not subtracted in a disagreement score, but its evaluation support can be target-derived. Plan 9/11 use a ground-truth 1\% mask; the recovered bank uses the target model's prediction mask, not ground truth. Anchor-CV uses held-out acquired anchors (including their masks); adjacent MAE uses masks from acquired pairs. These information regimes must not be conflated.
 
